  "name": "Flow 1 — 新預約通知 (Mina)",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f1-n1-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook — 收到預約",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "mina-booking",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "allEntries",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "f5505c9e-39b5-44fe-9518-4140811ff842"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1-n2-code",
      "name": "格式化通知內容",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = $input.first().json.body ?? $input.first().json;\nconst courses = Array.isArray(b.courses) ? b.courses.join('、') : (b.courses || '未填');\nconst now = new Date().toLocaleString('zh-TW', { timeZone: 'Asia/Taipei' });\n\nconst lineMsg = [\n  '【新試聽預約通知】',\n  `家長：${b.parentName || '未知'}`,\n  `電話：${b.phone || '未填'}`,\n  `學生：${b.studentName || '未填'}`,\n  `年級：${b.grade || '未填'}`,\n  `科目：${courses}`,\n  `時段：${b.preferredTime || '不限'}`,\n  `備注：${(b.note || '').trim() || '無'}`,\n  `時間：${now}`\n].join('\\n');\n\nconst emailBody = [\n  '【新試聽預約通知】',\n  '',\n  `家長姓名：${b.parentName || '未知'}`,\n  `聯絡電話：${b.phone || '未填'}`,\n  `學生姓名：${b.studentName || '未填'}`,\n  `年級：${b.grade || '未填'}`,\n  `有興趣課程：${courses}`,\n  `希望時段：${b.preferredTime || '不限'}`,\n  `備注：${(b.note || '').trim() || '無'}`,\n  '',\n  `預約時間：${now}`,\n  '',\n  '─────────────────────',\n  '此信由 Mina n8n 自動發送'\n].join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  lineMsg,\n  emailBody,\n  emailSubject: `【新試聽預約】${b.parentName || '?'} / ${b.grade || '?'} / ${b.phone || '?'}`\n}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f1-n3-line",
      "name": "發送 LINE Notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.line.me/v2/bot/message/broadcast",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"messages\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.lineMsg) }}}]}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f1-n4-email",
      "name": "發送 Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        440
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "BdOVsK33NdWdJUob",
          "name": "Gmail SMTP (Mina)"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "hua19911027@gmail.com",
        "toEmail": "hua19911027@gmail.com, monina1051208@gmail.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.emailSubject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.emailBody }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "12f1d595-cc67-4d1a-b92d-13c312b7e5db"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1-n5-note",
      "name": "⚙️ 設定說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flow 1 — 新預約通知\n\n**觸發**：網站預約表單送出（Cloudflare Worker 呼叫）\n\n邏輯：\n1. 收到 webhook → 格式化訊息\n2. 同時發送 LINE Notify + Gmail\n\n**必須設定：**\n\n**1. LINE Notify Token**\n在「發送 LINE Notify」節點的 Authorization header 中\n取代 ⬛TODO_LINE_NOTIFY_TOKEN\n\n**2. Gmail App Password**\nn8n → Credentials → Gmail SMTP (Mina)\n填入 Gmail 應用程式密碼（16碼）",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook — 收到預約": {
